{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08—S11等只有20至31秒的短段落里，纵向交替的信息仍然偏密，扫读速度不如X的左右分栏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用放大的关键词把每段心理转折标得更清楚，又通过分时出现的感受词，把怀念、愤怒、惊惧、犹疑和逐渐站稳落实到具体的音乐变化上，不只是给情绪贴标签。尤其是S03—S07的情绪反复、S09—S12的内心抉择，以及S13从重新燃起希望到接受未来不确定性的过程，Y保留了更多层次和前后呼应。X确实更容易快速扫读，叙述也比较流畅，但音乐细节和心理变化被压缩得较多，整体感染力与细腻程度不及Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6cb93cca-9754-4133-8f7f-a506ecc5b76e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T173110781025Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:32:07.195538+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8d9d3330ff5c008abd4026177fc4a6e1f6d880982ac883c861ab68b9c752a93", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat